New package paths are `internal/merkleinventory` and `internal/tmuxserver`;
there are no removed package paths or direct edges. The importer-package union
for canonicaljson, rpcwire and provhost is 25 packages at base and 27 on the
candidate. Every moved `(imported package, importer, entry, input class)` row
and its base/candidate outcome is in `internal/merkleinventory/IMPORTER-OUTCOMES.md`.
Moved classes are: canonicaljson adds validated Tombstone and Tombstone
Acknowledgement identity admission; merkleinventory adds RPC 2 roots/children/
objects request and response entry shapes through rpcwire; tmuxserver adds a
test-only ordinary `provhost.CreateIdentity` session fixture. The grid names
existing admitted inputs as unchanged where measured; it makes no universal
equivalence claim outside its named cases.

The fork-base 25-package importer set passed as one serialized process. The
candidate's 27-package set is a subset of the exact-tree 46-package configured
