### 0115 — Provider discovery leaf: the inventory gate caught a test proving nothing, and a trust test caught a double hash

- SCOPE: new `internal/provider` (Discover/Trust/Verify over a filesystem seam), `README.md` section, TASK-260830-2890sd §7.1.
