 ## 2026-09-24
 
+### TASK-260830-2h5uv9 rev5 — always-on common-ID position product
+
+- The configured generated sync test now runs its N≤3 bounded shard without a selector. A separate always-on 432-case production `DurableIndex.SyncFrom` product places a same-identity/different-bytes conflict at each of three sorted common-ID positions, crossed with all six arrival permutations, duplicate on/off, both skews, rounds 1–3, and two peer-only lease identities. It asserts literal `integrity_failure`, quarantine bytes, peer immutability, and conflict on retry.
+- Added AST skip census (zero unallowlisted skips), ordinary and token-preserving planted-skip refusals, and repository-root `.pyc`/`__pycache__` hygiene plus planted-artifact refusal. Removed the task-owned scratch Python cache; the focused selected tests and determinism run are green.
+- The four review narrowings—first namespace, first ID, last ID, even IDs only—are killed alone by `TestDurableSyncConflictAuditsEveryCommonIDPositionWithPeerOnlyRecord`; each rework plant was run in a targeted invocation and in the 86-row shipped harness. The token-preserving skip plant is killed by `TestSkipCensusRejectsAnUnjustifiedPlantedSkip`. The applied neutral comment control survives. Harness results: 85 kills, one control survivor, zero invalid rows.
+- Registry decode confirms all three Story acceptance cases occur in their declared clause bindings and names `SyncFrom` production ownership; digest re-derives to `2302a10a0174ada997614ea7d6112add30e9b2328f6b25ea796ea175f48568cd`. Tracecheck is green; README pin passes and the wrong-figure plant fails. Scoped diagnostics refuse at §5.3 (7/8), §10.7 (1/18), and §11.4 (6/7), as expected for the stated task boundary.
+- Exact `go list -test -json` comparison: fork base `0ca3e4c` to candidate is 44→46 package paths, 1,468→1,592 references, and 317→350 internal references; tracked target importer union is 25→27 with no removed target edges. New target callers are `merkleinventory` for canonicaljson/rpcwire and test-only `tmuxserver` for provhost. Base importer execution is reused from its immutable green evidence; all 27 candidate importers are in the exact candidate suite.
+- Focused package gate, `-count=3` determinism gate, Windows vet, gofmt, build, tracecheck, scratch-index diff check, and `task-board.config.json` byte comparison have green evidence. The exact full configured suite is being rerun after widening bytecode hygiene to the repository root; its result is attached only after its process exits.
+- Measured task acceptance ratio remains 1 of 2 criteria fully driven by named tests; the no-public-capability clause is a stated scope bound because this internal library adds no public advertisement entry point. The producer brief has no formal surface table; `coverage-map.md` records this as a brief gap. Candidate remains uncommitted at the Story checkpoint; current origin main is still `6d3bff9`.
+
